Synthesis & Consensus: Architectural Next Steps
1. Active Capsule Concurrency & Label Sanitization: Enforce a strict active capsule ceiling (maxActiveCapsules <= 15) and truncate capsule label strings to 24 characters with alphanumeric regex filtering in web/src/engines/ClayPneumaticTubeEngine.ts.
2. Audio Trigger Debouncing: Wrap Web Audio FM squelch and arrival chime triggers in a 150ms debounce guard in web/src/engines/ClayAudioSynth.ts to prevent acoustic clipping during rapid automated triggers.
3. Viewport-Aware Render Gating & Responsive Downsampling: Gate ClayPneumaticTubeEngine.render() behind an IntersectionObserver to pause the animation loop when off-screen, and scale ambient air particle count dynamically based on device pixel ratio and screen width.
4. Redis Telemetry Queue Depth Bridge: Connect Redis Pub/Sub task queue backlog metrics directly to pneumatic pressure modulation (12 PSI idle, 20 PSI nominal, 30 PSI surge) via web/src/gateway/pneumaticSwarmBridge.ts.
